---
interface Props { kind: 'snapshot' | 'hot' }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
---
<figure class="version-figure">
 {kind === 'snapshot' ? <>
  <div class="figure-label">Two versions after transaction 784 commits</div>
  <div class="versions">
   <div class="tuple old"><strong>Earlier version · slot 1</strong><span>product 1 · available <b>3</b></span><span>Created by 783 · replaced by 784</span></div>
   <div class="tuple new"><strong>Replacement · slot 2</strong><span>product 1 · available <b>1</b></span><span>Created by 784 · no replacement</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="readers">
   <div><strong>Report’s saved snapshot</strong><span>784 was still active when the snapshot was taken.</span><span class="answer old">Accept creation by 783.<br />Exclude replacement by 784.<br /><b>Read 3 from slot 1.</b></span></div>
   <div><strong>New reader’s snapshot</strong><span>784 committed before this snapshot was taken.</span><span class="answer new">Accept replacement by 784.<br />Accept creation by 784.<br /><b>Read 1 from slot 2.</b></span></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The report’s snapshot keeps its original boundary after 784 commits. Both readers inspect the same heap; their visibility decisions select different versions.</figcaption>
 </> : <>
  <div class="figure-label">The index keeps pointing to the chain’s first slot</div>
  <div class="hot-state"><strong>While the old snapshot is retained</strong><div class="chain"><div class="index">B-tree entry<br /><b>product 1 → (0,1)</b></div><span class="arrow" aria-label="points to">→</span><div class="tuple old">Heap page 0 · slot 1<br /><b>available 3</b><br />HOT link → (0,2)</div><span class="arrow" aria-label="links to">→</span><div class="tuple new">Heap page 0 · slot 2<br /><b>available 1</b><br />Heap-only version</div></div></div>
  <div class="hot-state"><strong>After that snapshot ends and cleanup runs</strong><div class="chain"><div class="index">Same B-tree entry<br /><b>product 1 → (0,1)</b></div><span class="arrow" aria-label="points to">→</span><div class="tuple redirect">Slot 1 · redirect<br /><b>No old row payload</b><br />Go to slot 2</div><span class="arrow" aria-label="redirects to">→</span><div class="tuple new">Heap page 0 · slot 2<br /><b>available 1</b><br />Still the current version</div></div></div>
  <figcaption>Cleanup can reclaim the earlier row’s bytes while retaining a small redirect at its item slot. The index entry still reaches the surviving version without a new entry for this HOT update.</figcaption>
 </>}
</figure>
<style>
 .version-figure{--old:#a06a39;--new:#43877c;margin:2rem 0;padding:1.2rem;border-block:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);background:var(--color-surface-alt);font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--color-text)}
 .figure-label{font-size:.76rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:1.1rem}
 .versions,.readers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.2rem}.tuple,.index{padding:.8rem;border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);border-radius:0}.tuple{border-left:3px solid var(--new)}.tuple.old{border-left-color:var(--old)}.tuple span,.readers span{display:block}.readers{margin-top:1.3rem}.readers>div{border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);padding-top:.8rem}.answer{margin-top:.6rem;border-left:3px solid var(--new);padding-left:.6rem}.answer.old{border-left-color:var(--old)}.hot-state+.hot-state{margin-top:1.5rem}.hot-state>strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.7rem}.chain{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;gap:.45rem;align-items:center}.chain .tuple,.chain .index{font-size:.8rem;padding:.65rem}.arrow{font-size:1.3rem}.redirect{border-left-style:dashed}.version-figure figcaption{margin-top:1rem;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.6}
 :global(:where(:root[data-theme="dark"])) .version-figure {--old:#d5a16a;--new:#83baae}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {:global(:where(:root:not([data-theme]))) .version-figure {--old:#d5a16a;--new:#83baae}}
 @media(max-width:600px){.versions,.readers{grid-template-columns:1fr}.chain{grid-template-columns:1fr}.arrow{text-align:center;transform:rotate(90deg);height:1.5rem}.chain .tuple,.chain .index{font-size:.88rem}.version-figure{padding:.9rem}}
</style>
